exports[`persist-with-rds engine upgrade surface (#664) given: [case1] a repo on dialect 10.7 with its own testdb pin when: [t1] apply runs then: the dao config moves to dialect 17, and keeps its own exclusions: codegen.sql.dao.yml — after 1`] = `
"language: postgres
dialect: 17
